    "detailed_description": "Ten 2 ten Poker is a 2 player turn based card game where the players take turns building poker hands. If you already know poker, learning Ten 2 Ten Poker is super simple! You don't have to worry about counting cards because all cards that have been dealt are always face up.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach poker hand you build is worth a certain amount of points. The player with the most points after 5 rounds wins. You can play by yourself, with a friend by creating/joining a private room, or against a random player with the Quick Match option.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach player is dealt 10 cards each and 2 community cards are placed in the middle. During each of your 5 turns you must select 5 cards to build a hand. This is where the strategy comes in. Will you play it safe and select a full house or will you save that 3 of a kind for the next round to see if you can build a 4 of a kind worth a ton of points? These are the types of the choices that make Ten 2 Ten Poker a fun and addicting card game.",
    "about_the_game": "Ten 2 ten Poker is a 2 player turn based card game where the players take turns building poker hands. If you already know poker, learning Ten 2 Ten Poker is super simple! You don't have to worry about counting cards because all cards that have been dealt are always face up.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach poker hand you build is worth a certain amount of points. The player with the most points after 5 rounds wins. You can play by yourself, with a friend by creating/joining a private room, or against a random player with the Quick Match option.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEach player is dealt 10 cards each and 2 community cards are placed in the middle. During each of your 5 turns you must select 5 cards to build a hand. This is where the strategy comes in. Will you play it safe and select a full house or will you save that 3 of a kind for the next round to see if you can build a 4 of a kind worth a ton of points? These are the types of the choices that make Ten 2 Ten Poker a fun and addicting card game.",
    "short_description": "Ten 2 ten Poker is a strategy-heavy 2 player turn based card game where the players take turns building poker hands. Each poker hand you build is worth a certain amount of points. The player with the most points after 5 rounds wins. Supports Single and Multiplayer.",
